WEBVTT

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:10.170
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:28.020
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:37.700
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:42.390
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:47.330
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:53.310
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:59.010
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:04.690
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:09.330
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:14.170
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.140
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:24.210
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:28.940
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:33.680
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:40.190
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:51.910
Distant mirror, nearby mirror,
sword to cut through negativity.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:54.780
Jewel of growth and life, jewel of fulfillment,

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.450
jewel to return from death,
jewel to remain on the true path.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.810
Gift to correct earthly disaster,
gift to correct aerial disaster.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.750
Countless gifts of purification and protection.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.270
Give energy to my spirit with these gifts.

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.900
Episode 3
PURIFICATION
OF THE GODS

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:18.490
There you go.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:19.660
Thanks!

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:33.340
You're late!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.540
For Pete's sake...

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.780
No coming late to a job, Boss!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:46.520
This is Ms. Shinogi Minagi, the one who hired us.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:49.090
How do you do, Mr. President?

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.990
S-Sorry! I'm really sorry!

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.230
Um, I mean, it's nothing.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:58.940
Sorry about that.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:02.510
This shrine is dedicated to
Futsunushi-no-kami, the god of swords.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.870
I always carry this thing. Don't worry about it.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.080
By the way, where's Mikan?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.170
Well...

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.080
Sorry I'm late!

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.250
I bought a ton of stuff.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.820
Thanks, Brother Pres!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:19.890
Boss...

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:20.690
Yeah?

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.130
You're too nice!

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:26.590
Sorry.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.930
You Astral people are a funny bunch.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:39.340
The truth is, I'd like to hire you as a saniwa.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.440
Saniwa?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:45.680
Saniwa. A person who can
hear the judgment of a god.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.620
In short, someone who can tell if
a summoned god is real or not,

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.750
what sort of god it is, and hear its voice.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:56.390
Tell the difference between gods?
You can do that?

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:58.050
You don't know about saniwa?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.960
Sorry. I'm still cramming for this job.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:04.330
But why do you want this saniwa?

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:10.000
People don't usually specifically hire
saniwa from other magical groups.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.780
Well, you see...

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:17.110
I asked for Astral because
a colleague of mine requested it.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.940
Looks like there are a lot of
circumstances involved here.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:22.260
I'll give you the details inside.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.160
And I hate to say this, but for Shintoists,
the inner sanctum of a shrine is...

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.060
...the most holy of holy places, so...

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.160
So having a foreign witch entering it
is out of the question, right?

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.860
No prob. I'll see you guys later.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.740
Brother Pres?

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:44.940
Miss Shinogi!

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.170
What's wrong?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.940
Um... May I perform a purification?

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.550
It's just... a little hard to breathe in here.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.310
Very well, as you wish.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:01.730
Even though I am most impure,
I ask that you cleanse me and grant clarity.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:05.030
Both within and without.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.900
Thanks. I feel better now.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.670
A misogi purification.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.570
Impressive. I can't do that.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.500
Please, come in.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.620
A... A child?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.150
My older brother. Moroha Minagi.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.060
What?
What?

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.920
Did you say older brother, Miss Shinogi?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.150
But he looks about my age.

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:40.220
10 years ago, when our grandfather,
the previous head of this shrine, died,

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:44.870
we were under pressure from the surrounding
shrines and it looked like we'd be shut down.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.840
What? Shrines back-stab each other like that?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.140
That's disgraceful!

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:51.440
The truth is, this isn't a
very old or historic shrine.

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.240
That's why it's been neglected.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.380
The Shinto Shrine Society is
all about lineage and history.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.020
Then, one day my big brother and I decided...

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.380
...we would become a priestess and
a saniwa and summon a god.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.760
It was to keep on protecting the shrine.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.430
Distant mirror, nearby mirror,
And to prove that a god did reside here.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.000
sword to cut through negativity.
And to prove that a god did reside here.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.470
Jewel of growth and life, jewel of fulfillment,

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.730
Jewel of growth and life, jewel of fulfillment,
However...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.470
jewel to return from death,
jewel to remain on the true path.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.540
Gift to correct earthly disaster,
gift to correct aerial disaster.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.370
Countless gifts of purification and protection.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.210
Give energy to my spirit with these gifts.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.720
When I regained consciousness...

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:48.400
And then, he was there, too.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.170
What terrible spell wave
contamination you've caused.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:54.870
What? Mr. Kagezaki?!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.540
Kagezaki, as in the one from The Association?!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.250
Summoning a god shouldn't
have been a taboo act.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:05.950
So why was The Association there?
What had happened?!

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.450
I don't remember a thing.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:13.050
If I had more power, then...

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.390
He's been asleep ever since.

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:20.330
Never aging, hair never growing.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.270
Just the same...

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.910
He had such amazing skill.

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:30.540
Almost as if he was the god of swords himself.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:36.610
Darn it!

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:43.720
Then the real purpose of this request is...

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:46.960
I'm at my limit for protecting
this shrine by myself.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.190
I want to hire the power of a saniwa.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:54.500
To once more summon Futsunushi-no-kami
and take my brother back!

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:07.640
If my brother doesn't come back,
this will be the end of the festival.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:15.620
My dealings with The Association
in the past have been troublesome.

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.630
There may be other circumstances
we don't know about, too.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.420
I'd pass on this if I were you.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.090
I'm thinking the same thing.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.920
Addie! What are you doing here?!

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.790
To get this drink. Really, these
Japanese summers are unbearable.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.070
Thank you.

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:33.230
You're not trying to poach
another job from us, are you?

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:38.140
Such a trivial job is beneath the
historic and storied Goetia company.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.310
According to the official Association rating,

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:43.990
Goetia is AAA while Astral is CCC.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.680
It's like the difference between heaven and earth.
You're hardly worth treating like a rival.

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:52.880
Um, so is this request really
dangerous or something?

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.820
A priestess who summons a god
is protected by that god.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.660
A saniwa, however, has to protect himself.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.870
If The Association knew about this case,

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:06.470
they'd have that boy killed for being
the source of the spell wave contamination.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:10.170
Naturally, you people would also face
some sort of punishment as well.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.170
I couldn't help you even if I wanted to.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:19.150
Shinto barriers are absolute,
repelling every sort of impurity.

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:22.650
My Celtic magic would be
severely weakened inside of it.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:25.790
What about Nekoyashiki?

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.860
He seems to have secluded
himself with his cats.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.030
Apparently, he's hand-making
ten thousand charms...

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:35.060
...as a reader giveaway for his occult magazine.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.600
Brother Pres!

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:39.370
I found some great material!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.950
Wow! You can read all this?

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.170
I am a priestess, you know.

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:48.440
Mikan... About this latest job...

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.980
We're turning it down.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.220
Huh? But why?!

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:53.210
I prepared for it and everything!

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:57.290
The thing is... If anything
were to happen to you, then...

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.220
I'm doing this!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.930
I love the festival at that shrine!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.670
I don't want this year's to be the last one!

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:10.160
I want to go there year after year!
Besides... I want to help!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:14.330
I'm doing this for Miss Shinogi
and for Astral, too.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:19.310
Because... I'm not just a substitute!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.580
Okay, if you put it that way...

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:32.220
Yay! Thank you, Brother Pres!

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:33.830
Yay! Yay!

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:34.850
You sure?

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.790
I don't want all of Mikan's enthusiasm
to have been for nothing.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.670
If anything goes wrong, I'll shield
Mikan with my own body to protect her!

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:44.500
That doesn't reassure me at all.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:48.310
Well, if the president's decided,
that's that, I guess.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.610
I guess we'll leave this to you, Mikan.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.870
In return, do a good job!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.040
Right!

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.580
Well, this is as far as I can go to see you off.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.350
Good luck, Mikan!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:03.580
Right!

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:16.370
Are you Astral's new member?

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:18.470
Yes.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.940
How do you do? I'm Kagezaki,
from The Association.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.130
The Association?

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.780
You mean the organization made up
of over 100 of the top magical groups?

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:30.750
The ones who punish mages who break taboos?

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:34.090
Oh! You know a lot for a newcomer.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.620
W-What brings you here today?

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:43.860
The Association has no stake in this job,
since Astral was directly contracted.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.900
However, there is a possibility...

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:49.670
...that you people may fail to
properly summon the god,

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:53.870
which may result in severe
spell wave contamination.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.870
You look rather nervous.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.110
It's about to begin.

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:10.660
Um... What is that?

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:14.980
Originally, it was a picture scroll
passed down through this shrine.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:18.620
It later fell into the hands of
others until it ended up with me.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:23.900
This shrine was the place where two
gods had their very first quarrel.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.270
After countless skirmishes,

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:29.640
Futsunushi-no-kami defeated
Takeminakata-no-kami,

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.200
ending the battle between gods.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:37.340
In other words, two gods reside in this shrine.

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:42.510
When they summon the gods, what if
Takeminakata-no-kami manifests first?

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:48.950
The rage of the imprisoned
Takeminakata-no-kami...

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:52.500
An enraged spirit would first turn its anger...

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.660
...on the body of the saniwa it manifests within.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:58.960
Distant mirror, nearby mirror,
sword to cut through negativity.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:02.010
Jewel of growth and life, jewel of fulfillment,

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.480
jewel to return from death,
jewel to remain on the true path.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.710
Gift to correct earthly disaster,
gift to correct aerial disaster.

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:08.520
Countless gifts of purification and protection.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:11.210
Give energy to my spirit with these gifts.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:17.920
Brother Moroha!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.190
Miss Shinogi!

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.870
Were we successful?

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.710
Futsunushi-no-kami?

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.540
My name... is Takeminakata-no-Kami!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:47.760
Why did another god appear?!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.520
T-This sensation... I remember it.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:55.060
That's right! That day, the one
who manifested within me was!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.810
Takeminakata-no-kami!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:14.270
The body of Takeminakata-no-kami himself
is causing the spell wave contamination.

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:16.040
I cannot overlook this.

00:14:16.550 --> 00:14:21.180
You knew? That there were
two gods at this shrine?!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:27.760
I beseech you, exalted to the limits of heaven,

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:31.960
creators of all things to the summit
of earth, great gods who rule earth!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:36.600
Let not this finite world fall and be spent.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:42.210
Share my life, pass through my spirit,
and let your glory shine!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.490
Moroha was able to use the spell
power of Futsunushi-no-kami...

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.720
...to hold back Takeminakata-no-kami.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:04.420
The the strain it placed on his
body was unimaginable.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.580
History repeats itself.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:26.750
Well, I suppose I get to earn my money
from Norma in The Association...

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.280
Mikan! Itsuki!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.990
The summoning of the gods has begun.

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.750
Where is Futsunushi-no-kami?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.650
You are a saniwa?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.570
Brother Pres!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.300
I'm okay. What about?

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.450
Miss Shinogi's okay, too.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.750
Hand over the saniwa!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.050
His Glam Sight...

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:44.090
If he looks at a god with it, then!

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.200
Don't! Whatever you do, don't take it off!

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:52.830
Brother Pres, this is... This is my job!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:53.740
Mikan...

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:10.420
Brother Pres, you and Sister Honami
said you were leaving this to me.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:11.820
But!

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:12.860
I'll be all right!

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.150
I have my own ways to deal with this!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.150
Trust me, Brother Pres!

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:19.600
Mikan...

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:52.190
Hi fu mi yo i mu na ya ko to mo chi ro ra ne!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.760
Shikiru, yuitsuwa, nuso wo tahaku,

00:17:56.300 --> 00:18:01.210
mekauo he yuki, rihete nomasu, ase horeke.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:10.050
Tamashizume...

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.510
A technique mastered by the Katsuragi clan.

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.850
Tamashizume?

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.050
A technique for calming gods.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:22.350
It involves sending the possessing god back
and then returning your spirit to your body.

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:24.520
It's difficult.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:29.290
Calming a god is many times
more difficult than summoning one.

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:46.840
The rage of this spirit is incredible!

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.790
I may not be able to handle this.

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:01.320
I'm not ready to take on a god!

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:23.550
Mikan, now!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:29.260
I guess we'll leave this to you, Mikan.
In return, do a good job!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:32.760
If anything goes wrong, I'll shield
Mikan with my own body to protect her!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.230
It's all right. I can do this.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.100
I can be useful to Astral!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:39.800
Tohokami, Emitame,

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:43.170
Kan Gon Shin Son Ri Kon Da Ken!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.600
Remove what is unclean, and purify!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:32.860
Big Brother!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:37.750
Big Brother!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:47.800
Looks like Mr. Kagezaki left.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:48.970
I see.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.580
Still, how did you get in there, Honami?

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:55.450
When Mikan's power began crumbling,
the barrier weakened momentarily.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:56.770
